    80	### Decimal summaries
    81	
    82	**Extensions:** `evenPos`, `oddPos`, `decEven`, and `decOdd`; their zero,
    83	negative-magnitude, and sign-split equations; the duplicate guarded zero
    84	simplifiers; and the guarded matching-logic recurrence equalities in
