   314	## Trust boundary
   315	
   316	- The unmodified files under `reference-semantics/` are trusted to represent
   317	  the relevant Python subset.
   318	- K v7.1.293, its Haskell/LLVM backends, SMT reasoning, and host arithmetic are
   319	  trusted.
   320	- The guarded decimal recurrence and sign-normalization simplification lemmas
   321	  are proof-local mathematical facts. They affect returned values but never
   322	  operational control or state. Their guards, overlaps, descent, and use sites
   323	  were audited; they are also supported by independent finite differential
